<td tEditID="c1r1" style=" background-color:#FFFFFF; color:#000000; bEditID:r3st1; bLabel:main; font-size:12pt; font-family:arial;" aEditID="c1r1" locked="0" >
<![CDATA[<table align="center" border="0" cellpadding="0" cellspacing="0" width="750" style="color: rgb(102, 102, 102); font-family: &quot;Ciutadella regular&quot;, Arial, Verdana, sans-serif; font-size: 14px; font-variant-ligatures: none; background-color: rgb(244, 245, 246);"><tbody><tr><td style="line-height: 20px; border: 0px; border-spacing: 0px;"><table align="center" border="0" cellpadding="0" cellspacing="0" width="680" style="text-align: center; border: 0px; border-spacing: 0px; padding: 0px;"><tbody><tr><td valign="top" style="font-variant-ligatures: none; font-size: 14px; color: rgb(102, 102, 102); line-height: 20px;"><table align="center" border="0" cellpadding="0" cellspacing="0"><tbody><tr width="680"><td align="center" style="font-variant-ligatures: none; font-size: 10px; color: rgb(102, 102, 102); line-height: 20px; text-align: center; height: 60px; width: 680px;"><div style="height: 15px; line-height: 15px;">Your Corporate Airfares Agreement variation&nbsp;</div></td></tr></tbody></table></td></tr><tr><td style="font-variant-ligatures: none; font-size: 14px; color: rgb(102, 102, 102); line-height: 20px;"><table border="0" cellpadding="0" cellspacing="0" style="width: 680px;"><tbody><tr><td style="font-variant-ligatures: none; font-size: 14px; color: rgb(102, 102, 102); line-height: 20px;"><table border="0" cellpadding="0" cellspacing="0"><tbody><tr><td style="font-variant-ligatures: none; font-size: 14px; color: rgb(102, 102, 102); line-height: 20px; background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255);"><a href="http://www.qantas.com/" target="_blank" style="color: rgb(102, 102, 102); text-decoration-line: none; border: 0px;"><img alt="Qantas" border="0" src="http://salesnews.qantas.com/imgproxy/img/2026710205/181022+qantas-header-brand-680x70.png" title="Qantas" width="680" style="display: block; width: 680px; height: 70px;"></a></td></tr></tbody></table></td></tr><tr><td style="font-variant-ligatures: none; font-size: 14px; color: rgb(102, 102, 102); line-height: 20px; height: 20px; margin: 0px; padding: 0px; background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255);">&nbsp;</td></tr></tbody></table></td></tr><tr><td style="font-variant-ligatures: none; font-size: 14px; color: rgb(102, 102, 102); line-height: 20px;"><table id="main-content" border="0" cellpadding="0" cellspacing="0" width="680" style="background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255); text-align: center;"><tbody><tr><td valign="top" style="font-variant-ligatures: none; font-size: 14px; color: rgb(102, 102, 102); line-height: 20px; height: 20px; text-align: left; width: 600px; padding-left: 40px; padding-right: 40px;">&nbsp;</td></tr><tr><td valign="top" style="font-variant-ligatures: none; font-size: 14px; color: rgb(102, 102, 102); line-height: 20px; height: 20px; text-align: left; width: 600px; padding-left: 40px; padding-right: 40px;">Dear &lt;AM to insert customer name&gt;,</td></tr><tr><td valign="top" style="font-variant-ligatures: none; font-size: 14px; color: rgb(102, 102, 102); line-height: 20px; height: 20px; text-align: left; width: 600px; padding-left: 40px; padding-right: 40px;"><br></td></tr><tr><td valign="top" style="font-variant-ligatures: none; font-size: 14px; color: rgb(102, 102, 102); line-height: 20px; height: 20px; text-align: left; width: 600px; padding-left: 40px; padding-right: 40px;"><p class="MsoNormal">We have tried to contact you recently regarding the extension
of your Qantas Corporate Airfares Agreement, and changes that we have made to
our domestic fare structure effective from November 4 2020.<br><br><b>Your current agreement expiry date has now passed. In
order to continue accessing the new reduced fares and new discount levels, we
require the attached extension and variation to be signed and returned to us as
soon as possible.<br><br></b>As a result of the domestic fare changes, we will be recalibrating
your corporate discounts to align with these reduced fares, effective from 1
December 2020. The changes to your discounts are outlined in the variation
agreement, which will need to be signed before 1 December 2020.<br><br>If you are unable to have the contract executed before 1
December 2020, please provide written (email) confirmation from yourself or
appropriate delegate acknowledging acceptance of the proposed contract changes
in advance of the signed variation, in order for these fare structure changes and
contract extension to be loaded.<br><br>In summary, these fare structure changes provide a package
of benefits including:</p>

<ul style="margin-top:0cm" type="disc">
 <li class="MsoNormal">Reduced fares at the top of the fare structure on some
     routes.<o:p></o:p></li>
 <li class="MsoNormal">Increasing the Red eDeal booking classes from 5 to 6,
     providing more price points within our restrictive fare family.<o:p></o:p></li>
 <li class="MsoNormal">Smoothing and reducing the cost of trading up the fare
     ladder in the Red eDeal fare family.<o:p></o:p></li>
 <li class="MsoNormal">As such we are recalibrating your corporate discounts
     in Flex (YB only) and Red eDeal (M only) to align with these reduced fares.<o:p></o:p></li>
 <li class="MsoNormal">Importantly and based on your steady state booking
     profile, these changes should result in no additional cost to your business.&nbsp;</li></ul>If you have already signed your agreement prior to receiving
this communication, please ignore.<br><br>Thank you for the ongoing support and please don’t hesitate
to reach out if you have any further questions.<br><br>Regards,<br>Qantas Corporate Sales<p class="MsoNormal"><o:p></o:p></p></td></tr><tr><td valign="top" style="font-variant-ligatures: none; font-size: 14px; color: rgb(102, 102, 102); line-height: 20px; height: 20px; text-align: left; width: 600px; padding-left: 40px; padding-right: 40px;">&nbsp;</td></tr><tr><td valign="top" style="font-variant-ligatures: none; font-size: 14px; color: rgb(102, 102, 102); line-height: 20px; height: 20px; text-align: left; width: 600px; padding-left: 40px; padding-right: 40px;"><i>Qantas Airways Limited</i></td></tr><tr><td valign="top" style="font-variant-ligatures: none; font-size: 14px; color: rgb(102, 102, 102); line-height: 20px; height: 20px; text-align: left; width: 600px; padding-left: 40px; padding-right: 40px;">&nbsp;</td></tr><tr><td valign="top" style="font-variant-ligatures: none; font-size: 14px; color: rgb(102, 102, 102); line-height: 20px; height: 20px; text-align: left; width: 600px; padding-left: 40px; padding-right: 40px;">&nbsp;</td></tr></tbody></table></td></tr><tr><td width="600" style="font-variant-ligatures: none; font-size: 14px; color: rgb(102, 102, 102); line-height: 20px; margin: 0px; padding: 0px 40px; height: 42px; max-width: 600px; border: 0px; width: 600px;"><table align="center" cellpadding="0" cellspacing="0" width="600" style="margin: 0px; padding: 0px; max-width: 600px; border: 0px; width: 600px;"><tbody><tr><td style="font-variant-ligatures: none; font-size: 14px; color: rgb(102, 102, 102); line-height: 20px; vertical-align: top; margin: 0px; padding: 22px 0px 0px; height: 45px; border: 0px;"><table cellpadding="0" cellspacing="0" width="100%" style="margin: 0px; padding: 0px; height: 40px; border: 0px;"><tbody><tr><td align="left" style="font-variant-ligatures: none; font-size: 14px; color: rgb(102, 102, 102); line-height: 20px; vertical-align: top; margin: 0px; padding: 0px; height: 40px;"><a href="https://www.facebook.com/Qantas/" target="_b